     "Roast",
     "Roast the hazelnuts at 350°F (175°C) for 8–10 minutes and rub the skins off with a towel."
    ],
    [
     "Butter",
     "Blend the hazelnuts alone until completely smooth and runny."
    ],
    [
     "Blend",
     "Add the almond milk, protein, cocoa, sweetener, salt and xanthan and blend until thick and smooth. Thin with milk a teaspoon at a time if needed."
    ],
